\":95043,\"title\":\"Bytt är bytt\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7LOrpgSTwddS2dvcWYzdQ2wfkxV.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4142857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":94653,\"title\":\"Taskmaster Norway\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/moZMbtcK2W2P35vemwW7xyBFLaf.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41250000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":743,\"title\":\"Beauty and the Geek\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/83lFzXescQFVzVkUmjwg1zqeMlm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41250000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"12 contestants face off in games of wit, strategy and wisdom over 6 nights and 7 days. Who will be crowned the ultimate victor?\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vNoINLWniSpqS2Qaol4BINX7BSY.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Twelve contestants begin their 7-day journey. The first match is nothing like what they've expected — it's time to get those brain cells working!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wWLnMzA2IVfC5e9Q5hJs12T23Ne.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":10,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":71},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"The results of the first match have everyone shocked. Someone from the losing team must go to jail. When the next match begins, conflict starts brewing.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uDEFNF3oC3SudPQ7pmyzh6svuuf.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":8,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":59},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"It's day 2, and people are eager to form deeper alliances. This time, the match will result in the very first elimination. Who will be sent home?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6HNOeSwXJMHzWGWziYH9YYJfuDq.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":71},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"The group grows emotional over the result of the first elimination. Meanwhile, a contestant happens upon a secret hidden by the Devil.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/80hFM4pnNVDcIlojmHZZVRPytyr.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-09-26\",\"runtime\":62},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"The ORBIT alliance or a new alliance? While the contestants rethink their loyalties, someone commits an act of betrayal during the main match.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/shhkdVOSqhkdECc8qFmxZf6u2Dk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":67},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"A betrayal leads to an unforeseen elimination. Emotions flare among the remaining players, but in this prize match, they must work as a team.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wgFJgATsLG514XLnSSr9Ge2BAvm.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":58},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"It's day 4, and a group commits a fatal mistake. As their allegiances waver, other contestants come closer to unlocking the Devil's secret.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbtQGPSNm8HUPxAxsWfrPfoMUXJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":69},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The contestants struggle to solve the Devil's secret. During the fifth main match, Lee See-won attempts to face off against ORBIT.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/52pTzAhPVWnzUzF6350NSykntt.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":61},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"The competition takes a new turn due to one player's surprising move. Shortly afterward, the truth surrounding the move is revealed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pXy9pCurENmIh7qe32H6F9vQUAX.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-03\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"The secrets of the prison result in a painful night for some. The last main match of the competition commences. Who will move on to the next round?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2yzpXEHtQWhny8D2K3YXwm0w1ep.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-10\",\"runtime\":68},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"Contestants give it their all in the main match, but only three emerge triumphant. The last prize match begins.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9QVBYnaWTFCHiQc2YbYbzUiekTW.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-10\",\"runtime\":70},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"The 7-day journey is nearing the end, and it's time for the final match. Who among the remaining two will be crowned winner?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5FYh8NabRopx9UJTLqYVYBK1ETF.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-10\",\"runtime\":75}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-09-26\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}